", "thinking_blocks": [], "responses_reasoning_item": null, "action": {"stage": "result", "answer": "# Experiment Design: Does fusing Adam (TorchOpt) yield a less complex, more interpretable gradient graph in TorchViz output than unfused Adam?

**Status: design-only deliverable. No experiment has been run; no results are reported or implied.**

